ns","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T06:22:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T06:31:59Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/20d58a38c67b956d007e594c551dab39bd68efc1/editor/run/game_view_plugin.cpp#L862-L867\n\nThe button state is completely disconnected from the actual audio state, therefore its icon is misleading and does not properly mirror the source of truth, i think it would be an improvement if `debugger->set_debug_mute_audio(debug_mute_audio);` returns a result that it is checked before actually changing the button state","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3895143559/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909563376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116127#issuecomment-3909563376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116127","id":3909563376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pBzPw","user":{"login":"csotog98","id":78771410,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NzcxNDEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78771410?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98","html_url":"https://github.com/csotog98","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csotog98/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T16:56:32Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T16:56:32Z","body":"> Video at: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21430714-07d3-4822-b7bb-7c0862cdb73e\n\nYou didn't pause it (F7).\nHappens to me too. Also, you do the trick and doesn't have audio, everytime I unmute after I mute It doesn't have audio either:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d06df7f9-b627-4e31-82ea-21a4e42229fc","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909563376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3911582288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116127#issuecomment-3911582288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116127","id":3911582288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pJgJQ","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T02:07:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T02:07:38Z","body":"I tested on a Mac on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/releases/tag/4.6.1-stable and it works as expected.\n[Here](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25353218/audio-stream-pause.zip) is the MRP that used to test it when I implemented this and is the same one that I used to try to reproduce it on the latest stable 4.6.1.\nCould you use this MRP on your environment to reproduce the issue?\nThat will be helpful to see if it could be OS related or it's something else.\nIf you are not able to reproduce it with my MRP, please upload yours, that will be really valuable to me to try to come up with a fix.\nSorry for not being helpful yet and throwing the classic: it works in my machine. I'm hoping that sharing ours MRP will let us fix this issue.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3911582288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3912062003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116127#issuecomment-3912062003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116127","id":3912062003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pLVQz","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T03:46:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T03:56:48Z","body":"\n> Could you use this MRP on your environment to reproduce the issue?\n\nI could reproduce it with 4.6.1 with this MRP. I got it to happen on both Windows and Linux (CachyOS/Arch). \n\nIt seems to be that if you pause the game (with F7, _not_ with suspend F9), and terminate the game while its paused, from then on, unmuting with the button stops working. If you start with it unmuted, sound will play, but once muted, it cannot be unmuted without restarting the game.\n\nReloading the project in the editor fixes it.\n\nI found you don't even have to mute or unmute while paused (or running). Simply starting the project, pause, then terminate will cause the unmute button to stop working.\n\nMuting while the game is suspended with F9 does not seem to have an issue. I tried a bunch of different combinations of pause, unpause, mute, unmute, and terminate, and couldn't get the issue to happen.\n\nEdit: In 4.5.1, pausing with F7 doesn't stop the audio like in 4.6, so its probably an issue with however that change was implemented.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3912062003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3934722973","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116127#issuecomment-3934722973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116127","id":3934722973,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qhxud","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T13:38:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T13:39:45Z","body":"Thanks @BuzzLord!!! (your comment help me to to reproduce the issue locally)\nIt will be great if you can test my fix","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3934722973/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]